      "entries": [
        "Mistress Dusklight shoots a captivating look at one creature within 60 feet, who must be stupefied. Until the end of its next turn, the creature is fascinated by Mistress Dusklight and can't use hostile actions toward her. The victim is then temporarily immune for 10 minutes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Black Cat Curse",
      "category": "action",
      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": {
        "unit": "action",
        "number": 1,
        "symbol": "◆"
      },
      "traits": [
        "auditory",
        "curse",
        "enchantment",
        "occult",
        "mental",
        "misfortune"
      ],
      "entries": [
        "Mistress Dusklight spews a hatefully uttered curse at one creature within 30 feet that she can see. If the target fails a DC 32 Will save, whenever it attempts an attack roll or saving throw, it must roll twice and use the lower result. The target is then temporarily immune for 24 hours. The curse persists until it is removed or the target succeeds a later saving throw against it. The victim can attempt a new DC 32 Will save once per hour to end the curse."
      ],
      "frequency": {
        "number": 1,
        "unit": "round",
        "text": null
      },
